(Japanese: '''{{j|～わいわいクッキング！～}}''' ''~Cheerful Cooking!~'') is the second volume of the [[Welcome! Pokémon Café: PikaVee's Mixing à la mode]] manga written by {{j|すずきさなえ}} Sanae Suzuki and illustrated by {{j|ふじのきともこ}} Tomoko Fujinoki. It is 38 pages long.

